Package: OmicChainPipeline
Type: Project
Title: OmicChain DESeq2 analysis pipeline dependencies
Description: Not a real R package to install: this file lists the packages the
    analysis depends on. snapshot_renv.R records them, with their dependencies
    and versions, in renv.lock (the certified R environment). Rsubread aligns and
    counts the FASTQ files. BiocVersion records the Bioconductor release, so that
    every installation (renv::restore, BiocManager, the container image) gives
    the same record.
Imports:
    DESeq2,
    tibble,
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    pheatmap,
    RColorBrewer,
    clusterProfiler,
    org.Hs.eg.db,
    AnnotationDbi,
    gridExtra,
    tiff,
    BiocManager,
    Biobase,
    apeglm,
    ggrepel,
    Rsubread,
    BiocVersion
